<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippines okays Urban thrift bank unit.</title>
<headline>Philippines okays Urban thrift bank unit.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippine Central Bank said on Thursday it had approved the establishment of Urban Bank Corp's thrift bank subsidiary.</p>
<p>The thrift bank, which will be called Urbancorp Development Bank, will be based in the central Cebu province.</p>
<p>The bank will have an authorised capital stock of 500 million pesos.</p>
<p>Thrift banks have a lower capital base requirement compared to commercial banks and their operations are restricted to only borrowing and lending.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
